SD-8510 Runtime Exception
------------------------------------------------------------

As an additional permission under Section 7 of the GNU General Public
License version 2, programs written to execute on the SD-8510 CPU
instruction set as part of the VC-2 system are not considered derivative
works of this software and are not subject to the terms of the GNU
General Public License. Authors of such programs may license them under
terms of their choosing.

This exception applies only to software that executes on the SD-8510 CPU
and does not apply to software that implements, emulates, reimplements,
or derives from the SD-8510 CPU, assembler, runtime system, or other
components of this software.

This exception does not grant permission to modify, distribute, or
create derivative works of the SD-8510 CPU / VC-2 source code itself,
except as permitted under the GNU General Public License version 2.
